{"metadata":{"role":"symbol","modules":[{"name":"Components"}],"externalID":"s:14OUDSComponents29OUDSCircularProgressIndicatorV","roleHeading":"Structure","symbolKind":"struct","navigatorTitle":[{"text":"OUDSCircularProgressIndicator","kind":"identifier"}],"platforms":[{"deprecated":false,"unavailable":false,"beta":false,"introducedAt":"15.0","name":"iOS"},{"deprecated":false,"unavailable":false,"beta":false,"introducedAt":"13.0","name":"macOS"},{"deprecated":false,"unavailable":false,"beta":false,"introducedAt":"16.0","name":"tvOS"},{"beta":false,"name":"visionOS","deprecated":false,"unavailable":false,"introducedAt":"1.0"},{"beta":false,"name":"watchOS","deprecated":false,"unavailable":false,"introducedAt":"11.0"}],"title":"OUDSCircularProgressIndicator","fragments":[{"text":"struct","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"OUDSCircularProgressIndicator","kind":"identifier"}]},"primaryContentSections":[{"declarations":[{"platforms":["macOS"],"tokens":[{"text":"@","kind":"attribute"},{"text":"MainActor","preciseIdentifier":"s:ScM","kind":"attribute"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"struct","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"OUDSCircularProgressIndicator","kind":"identifier"}],"languages":["swift"]}],"kind":"declarations"},{"mentions":["doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/documentation\/OUDSComponents\/Indicators"],"kind":"mentions"},{"content":[{"level":2,"text":"Variants","anchor":"Variants","type":"heading"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Two variants are provided:"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"type":"unorderedList","items":[{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Determinate"}]},{"type":"text","text":": the caller provides a "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"progress"},{"type":"text","text":" value in "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"[0, 1]"},{"type":"text","text":". Values outside this range are coerced."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Shows the exact progress of a task, usually as a percentage from 0% to 100%."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Provides clear and measurable feedback, helping users understand how long the task will take and reducing uncertainty."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Use determinate indicators whenever possible. Avoid indeterminate when progress can be measured, e.g."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"when the progress value is known (e.g. file upload, installation, data sync) or when the system can estimate completion time or percentage"}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"text":"Indeterminate","type":"text"}]},{"type":"text","text":": no "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"progress"},{"type":"text","text":" is provided and the indicator loops continuously."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Shows that a process is active without indicating exact progress."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Used when the system cannot determine how long the task will take."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Communicates that the system is working, even without precise data, and prevents users from thinking the interface is frozen."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"For long loading times (over 5 seconds), additional context must be provided."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"This helps inform users about the system state, reduces uncertainty, and prevents the interface from being perceived as unresponsive."}]}]}]},{"type":"heading","level":2,"text":"Statuses","anchor":"Statuses"},{"type":"unorderedList","items":[{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"text":"Neutral","type":"text"}]},{"type":"text","text":": default status used when progress has no specific semantic meaning. Suitable for generic loading,"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"processing, synchronization or background tasks."}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"text":"Accent","type":"text"}]},{"text":": used to highlight primary or brand-related actions (uploads, downloads, installations, onboarding).","type":"text"}]}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Positive"}]},{"text":": indicates successful progress or a process leading to a successful outcome.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"text":"Info","type":"text"}]},{"text":": indicates informational or system-related processes (background synchronization, data retrieval).","type":"text"}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"text":"Warning","type":"text"}]},{"text":": indicates progress related to an operation that requires user attention or should be monitored.","type":"text"}]}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Negative"}],"type":"strong"},{"text":": indicates progress related to an error, recovery, cancellation or failure.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]}]},{"text":"Gap size","type":"heading","level":2,"anchor":"Gap-size"},{"type":"unorderedList","items":[{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"default"}]},{"type":"text","text":": standard gap between the indicator and the track (about 14° of arc)."}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"small"}],"type":"strong"},{"type":"text","text":": reduced gap for a more compact appearance."}]}]}]},{"text":"Track","level":2,"anchor":"Track","type":"heading"},{"items":[{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"code":"true","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" (default): the track is displayed. Recommended when the indicator is shown on its own and needs a clear","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"structure. The track helps define the full range of progress and makes the value easier to read.","type":"text"}]}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"code":"false","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":": the track is hidden. Recommended when the indicator is embedded inside another component","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"(button, tag, toast) or when a more minimal appearance is needed.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]}],"type":"unorderedList"},{"text":"Animation (determinate mode only)","level":2,"anchor":"Animation-determinate-mode-only","type":"heading"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"When "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"animated"},{"type":"text","text":" is "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"true"},{"type":"text","text":" (default), the determinate indicator progressively fills from "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"0"},{"type":"text","text":" to the target"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"progress"},{"type":"text","text":" on first display, and animates any subsequent change of "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"progress"},{"type":"text","text":". When "},{"code":"animated","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" is "},{"code":"false","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":","},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"the indicator is displayed instantly at its target value with no animation."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Animations are always disabled when ","type":"text"},{"code":"accessibilityReduceMotion","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" is ","type":"text"},{"code":"true","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" or when Low Power Mode is enabled,","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"regardless of the ","type":"text"},{"code":"animated","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" flag.","type":"text"}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"The indeterminate mode is not affected by this flag: its Android Material 3 animation is intrinsic to the mode.","type":"text"}]},{"level":2,"text":"Helper text","type":"heading","anchor":"Helper-text"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"An optional text displayed below the circular indicator to provide context or additional information."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"The helper text is always centered under the indicator."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"In ","type":"text"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"determinate","type":"text"}],"type":"strong"},{"text":" mode, use ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/documentation\/OUDSComponents\/OUDSCircularProgressIndicator\/HelperTextType","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"text":" which offers two variants:","type":"text"}]},{"items":[{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":".description(_:)"}],"type":"strong"},{"text":": Displays a simple description text without the progress percentage.","type":"text"}]}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":".percent(_:)"}]},{"text":": Displays the progress percentage with an optional description. The percentage","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"value and its ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"%"},{"text":" symbol are assembled through the localized wording key","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"core_progressIndicator_percent_value"},{"text":", so the symbol, its spacing and its position follow the","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"typographic rules of the current language (e.g. ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"\"75%\""},{"text":" in English, ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"\"75 %\""},{"text":" in French, ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"\"٪75\""},{"text":" in Arabic).","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]}],"type":"unorderedList"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"In "},{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"text":"indeterminate","type":"text"}]},{"type":"text","text":" mode, the "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"helperText"},{"type":"text","text":" parameter is a simple "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"String?"},{"type":"text","text":"."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"type":"heading","text":"Code samples","anchor":"Code-samples","level":2},{"type":"codeListing","code":["    \/\/ Determinate - default (neutral, with track, default gap, reveal animation on display)","    OUDSCircularProgressIndicator(progress: 0.75)","","    \/\/ Determinate with an accent status and no track","    OUDSCircularProgressIndicator(progress: 0.5, status: .accent, track: false)","","    \/\/ Determinate with a warning status and a small gap","    OUDSCircularProgressIndicator(progress: 0.3, status: .warning, gapSize: .small)","","    \/\/ Determinate displayed instantly at its target value, without any animation","    OUDSCircularProgressIndicator(progress: 0.75, animated: false)","","    \/\/ Determinate with helper text","    OUDSCircularProgressIndicator(progress: 0.75, helperText: .description(\"Uploading...\"))","","    \/\/ Determinate with percentage and description","    OUDSCircularProgressIndicator(progress: 0.75,","                                  helperText: .percent(\"of 100 MB\"))","","    \/\/ Indeterminate","    OUDSCircularProgressIndicator()","    OUDSCircularProgressIndicator(status: .info)","","    \/\/ Indeterminate with helper text","    OUDSCircularProgressIndicator(status: .info, helperText: \"Processing...\")"],"syntax":"swift"},{"type":"heading","level":2,"text":"Accessibility considerations","anchor":"Accessibility-considerations"},{"type":"unorderedList","items":[{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"In "},{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"text":"determinate","type":"text"}]},{"type":"text","text":" mode, the view exposes the current progress as an accessibility value (percentage) so that"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"VoiceOver reads e.g. "},{"type":"emphasis","inlineContent":[{"text":"“75 percent”","type":"text"}]},{"type":"text","text":", and is marked with the "},{"code":".updatesFrequently","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" trait so that assistive"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"technologies know the value is changing."}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The indicator never captures "},{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"text":"Full Keyboard Access","type":"text"}]},{"type":"text","text":" focus, as no interaction is possible on a progress"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"indicator. On iOS 17+ \/ macOS 14+ \/ visionOS 1+ \/ watchOS 10+ \/ tvOS 17+, this is enforced via"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"accessibilityRespondsToUserInteraction(false)"},{"type":"text","text":"; on earlier OS versions, the semantic "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":".isStaticText"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"trait is used."}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"In ","type":"text"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"indeterminate"}],"type":"strong"},{"text":" mode, the view is hidden from VoiceOver (","type":"text"},{"code":".accessibilityHidden(true)","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":") — and therefore","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"also excluded from Full Keyboard Access navigation: there is no readable value to expose and keeping the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"element focusable would only pollute navigation."}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Animations are disabled when "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"accessibilityReduceMotion"},{"type":"text","text":" is "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"true"},{"type":"text","text":" or when Low Power Mode is enabled."}]}]}]},{"level":2,"text":"Colored surfaces","type":"heading","anchor":"Colored-surfaces"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"When placed on an "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/documentation\/OUDSComponents\/OUDSColoredSurface","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":", the indicator switches to a "},{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"monochrome"}]},{"type":"text","text":" rendering, the "},{"code":"status","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" is"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"ignored."}]},{"level":2,"text":"Design documentation","type":"heading","anchor":"Design-documentation"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"identifier":"https:\/\/unified-design-system.orange.com","type":"reference","isActive":true}]},{"level":2,"text":"Themes rendering","type":"heading","anchor":"Themes-rendering"},{"level":3,"text":"Orange","type":"heading","anchor":"Orange"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"image","identifier":"component_progress_indicator_circular_Orange"}]},{"level":3,"text":"Orange Compact","type":"heading","anchor":"Orange-Compact"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"image","identifier":"component_progress_indicator_circular_OrangeCompact"}]},{"text":"Sosh","anchor":"Sosh","level":3,"type":"heading"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"image","identifier":"component_progress_indicator_circular_Sosh"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"text":"Wireframe","type":"heading","anchor":"Wireframe","level":3},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"image","identifier":"component_progress_indicator_circular_Wireframe"}]},{"type":"aside","name":"Version","content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"1.2.0 (Figma component design version)","type":"text"}]}],"style":"note"},{"type":"aside","name":"Since","content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"3.0.0"}]}],"style":"note"}],"kind":"content"}],"kind":"symbol","sections":[],"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"A circular indicator shows the progress of a task using a circle."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"It can show a specific value (determinate) or just that something is in progress (indeterminate)."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Useful when you need more visual focus or when space is limited."}],"schemaVersion":{"minor":3,"major":0,"patch":0},"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/documentation\/OUDSComponents"]]},"topicSections":[{"generated":true,"title":"Initializers","anchor":"Initializers","identifiers":["doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/documentation\/OUDSComponents\/OUDSCircularProgressIndicator\/init(progress:status:track:gapSize:animated:size:helperText:)","doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/documentation\/OUDSComponents\/OUDSCircularProgressIndicator\/init(status:track:gapSize:size:helperText:)"]},{"generated":true,"title":"Instance Properties","anchor":"Instance-Properties","identifiers":["doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/documentation\/OUDSComponents\/OUDSCircularProgressIndicator\/body"]},{"generated":true,"title":"Type Properties","anchor":"Type-Properties","identifiers":["doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/documentation\/OUDSComponents\/OUDSCircularProgressIndicator\/defaultSize"]},{"generated":true,"title":"Enumerations","anchor":"Enumerations","identifiers":["doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/documentation\/OUDSComponents\/OUDSCircularProgressIndicator\/HelperTextType"]},{"generated":true,"title":"Default Implementations","anchor":"Default-Implementations","identifiers":["doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/documentation\/OUDSComponents\/OUDSCircularProgressIndicator\/View-Implementations","doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/documentation\/OUDSComponents\/OUDSCircularProgressIndicator\/View-Implementations"]}],"relationshipsSections":[{"type":"conformsTo","title":"Conforms To","identifiers":["doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/s8SendableP","doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/s16SendableMetatypeP","doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/7SwiftUI4ViewP"],"kind":"relationships"}],"identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/OUDSCompo